      },
      "lineNbr": 19,
      "author": {
        "id": 1415877
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-11T08:27:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`# llndk` is to tell the symbol is exclusively LLNDK.\n`# llndk-introduced\u003d` is to tell when it\u0027s introduced.",
      "parentUuid": "892e6734_d736db64",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 19,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 19,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "d298dc85b10463c1c1257286feddb6f8f9ebe1ef",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0eb93938_43eb0f45",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 19,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-11T08:36:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`#llndk-introduced\u003d` is awkward because it not only specifies when it was added, but also specifies that it\u0027s a member of LLNDK. A single tag shouldn\u0027t do two things.",
      "parentUuid": "782622fa_aa2a5378",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 19,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 19,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "d298dc85b10463c1c1257286feddb6f8f9ebe1ef",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c00aefb7_8c3a044c",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 19,
      "author": {
        "id": 1415877
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-11T08:42:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not. The membership is controlled by mode tags. `llndk-introduced` is an attribute for LLNDK mode just like `introduced\u003d` is an attribute for NDK.\n\n```\nfoo; # introduced\u003dx llndk-introduced\u003dxxxxxx\nbar; # llndk llndk-introduced\u003dxxxx\n```\n\n- foo is NDK (introduced in xx) and LLNDK(introduced in xxxxxx)\n- bar is LLNDK(introduced in xxxxxx)",
      "parentUuid": "0eb93938_43eb0f45",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 19,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 19,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "d298dc85b10463c1c1257286feddb6f8f9ebe1ef",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
